cards:[['Which Article covers the CM\'s duties towards the Governor?','**Art 167**'],['Can a non-member be appointed CM?','Yes, for **6 months**'],['Which case barred repeated 6-month non-member ministerships?','**S.R. Chaudhuri (2001)**'],['Who was the first woman CM?','**Sucheta Kripalani** (UP, 1963)'],['To whom is the State CoM collectively responsible?','The **Legislative Assembly**']],
